@startuml State_SyncSession
title Synchronization session (public.synchronizations.status)
[*] --> PENDING : POST /sync (plan created)
PENDING --> RUNNING : first journaled change\nor PATCH RUNNING
PENDING --> COMPLETED : nothing to do
RUNNING --> RUNNING : PATCH (progress / heartbeat)
RUNNING --> COMPLETED : PATCH COMPLETED
RUNNING --> FAILED : PATCH FAILED\nor abandoned (no activity 10 min)
PENDING --> CANCEL_REQUESTED : POST /sync/{id}/cancel
RUNNING --> CANCEL_REQUESTED : POST /sync/{id}/cancel
note right of CANCEL_REQUESTED : no further journaled changes\n(409 sync_cancelled)
CANCEL_REQUESTED --> ROLLING_BACK : POST /sync/{id}/rollback\n(server reverses remote changes)
ROLLING_BACK --> CANCELLED : rollback/finish\n(client restored local changes)
ROLLING_BACK --> ROLLBACK_FAILED : rollback/finish\n(some change not restored)
ROLLBACK_FAILED --> ROLLING_BACK : retry
COMPLETED --> [*]
FAILED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
@enduml
